This is the full detail to send over and format in this way: 

{"<field1>": "Example heading", "<field2>": ["Option A", "Option B", "Option C"]}

Rules: describe EACH field the card reads — its type, whether it is required or optional, allowed values, and defaults. Use the EXACT field names the LWC parses (<field1>, <field2>, ...). Do not emit empty arrays for required list fields. This description is the single contract the planner follows; keep it identical in meaning to what the LWC reads.
